<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani stocks index falls below 1,400 points.</title>
<headline>Pakistani stocks index falls below 1,400 points.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange 100-share price index fell below 1,400 points to 1,396.49 on Sunday because of little interest in buying shares and a lack of support from institutions, dealers said.</p>
</text>
